# The Masamune: "As long as equipped creature is attacking, it has first strike and must be blocked if able" (CR 702.7,
# 509.1c, 613.1f). Turn 1: Bot1 casts a Savannah Lions (2/1), The Masamune with a Black Lotus and a Mox, and equips the Lions.
# Turn 2: Bot2 casts Elvish Mystic (1/1) and an Ornithopter. Turn 3: the Lions attack; no first strike beforehand, and Bot2
# may not decline to block: of the Mystic and the Ornithopter, able to block, one of them
# must block. The Mystic blocks: the Lions have first strike and kill it before it deals damage, so the Lions survive, and
# once combat is over they have no first strike.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Savannah Lions
The Masamune
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Ornithopter
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Sacrifice: X; Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Savannah Lions.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Masamune.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.The Masamune.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Savannah Lions; Ability: Equip)
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Savannah Lions.Keywords = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Savannah Lions > Bot2)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Savannah Lions.Keywords = FirstStrike
! Bot2.Block(Count: 0)
Bot2.Block(Elvish Mystic > Savannah Lions)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Savannah Lions.Keywords = (absent)

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Savannah Lions; The Masamune
